# The Vicasque's Sermon (sandoria 9) at Abioleget against Her Memories: Homecoming Queen (crystalWar 64, Lua), whose
# Faux Pas section (accepted, The Faux Pas not completed) answers Abioleget with progressEvent 869 at Prog2 0 and
# event(871):oncePerZone() otherwise. The reply kinds: 589 (Progress) ties with 869 (Progress), so the lookup's action
# cycle plays both over two talks (an Event 589 would lose to 869), and beats 871 (Event); WILL_PROVIDE_PITTANCE (Message)
# loses to 871 once (then 871 is Default for the zone) and to 869; 600 (Progress) ties with 869 (an Event 600
# would lose to it). After each finish that changes a state (869: Prog2 1 and The Faux Pas added; 589: begun) the GM
# puts it back.
lists NorthernSanDoria/Abioleget/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/589 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/600
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=130.3,0.0,118.5 job=WAR lvl=30 gil=1000
quest Sandoria.WatersOfTheCheval completed
quest CrystalWar.HerMemoriesHomecomingQueen accepted
login
trigger Abioleget                         # 589 and 869 both Progress: the cycle's first, 869 (Her Memories' container
                                          # comes first)
finish                                    # Prog2 1, The Faux Pas added
charvar Quest[7][64]Prog2 0
quest Sandoria.TheVicasquesSermon available
trigger Abioleget                         # the cycle's second: 589
finish                                    # begun
charvar Quest[7][64]Prog2 0
quest Sandoria.TheVicasquesSermon available
charvar Quest[7][64]Prog2 1
trigger Abioleget                         # 589 (Progress) over 871 (Event)
finish                                    # begun
trigger Abioleget                         # accepted, Prog 0: 871 (Event) over WILL_PROVIDE_PITTANCE (Message)
finish                                    # 871 is Default in this zone from now on
trigger Abioleget                         # WILL_PROVIDE_PITTANCE over 871 (Default)
charvar Quest[7][64]Prog2 0
trigger Abioleget                         # 869 (Progress) over WILL_PROVIDE_PITTANCE
finish                                    # Prog2 1
charvar Quest[7][64]Prog2 0
charvar Quest[0][9]Prog 1
trigger Abioleget                         # 600 and 869 both Progress; the cycle's last pick was 589 (talks with
                                          # one winner leave it), which is not here: the first, 869
finish                                    # Prog2 1
charvar Quest[7][64]Prog2 0
trigger Abioleget                         # 600 and 869 again: the cycle's next after 869, 600
finish                                    # completed
